---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Nutrition Guides - Calories, BMR, TDEE & Macros | CalorieAce"
  description="Free nutrition guides covering calories, BMR, TDEE, calorie deficit, calorie surplus, and macro calculation — everything you need to understand your daily nutrition numbers."
>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-charcoal leading-tight">
      Nutrition <span class="text-forest">Guides</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-3 font-body text-lg text-gray-soft max-w-lg">
      Everything you need to understand your calorie and nutrition numbers, explained clearly.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
      <a href="/blog/how-many-calories-per-day" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-forest-light hover:border-forest transition-colors">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">How Many Calories Should I Eat a Day?</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body text-gray-soft">Learn how age, sex, and activity level determine your daily calorie needs.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/what-is-bmr" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-forest-light hover:border-forest transition-colors">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">What is BMR and Why Does It Matter?</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body text-gray-soft">Understand Basal Metabolic Rate and why it's the foundation of your calorie needs.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/calorie-deficit-explained" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-forest-light hover:border-forest transition-colors">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">Calorie Deficit Explained: How to Lose Weight Safely</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body text-gray-soft">How big your deficit should be, and why cutting too much can backfire.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/calorie-surplus-explained" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-forest-light hover:border-forest transition-colors">
         <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">Calorie Surplus Explained: How to Gain Weight Healthily</h2>
         <p class="mt-1 font-body text-gray-soft">How to gain weight without excess fat, and why pairing it with training matters.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/blog/how-to-calculate-macros" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-forest-light hover:border-forest transition-colors">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-charcoal">How to Calculate Your Macros (Protein, Carbs, Fat)</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 font-body text-gray-soft">The 4-4-9 method explained, and what a reasonable macro split looks like.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>